WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:11.339
In tutorial 8.1, you'll check how often AI
assistants name your business when buyers

00:00:11.389 --> 00:00:12.140
ask them.

00:00:13.181 --> 00:00:18.688
First, open AI visibility in the sidebar,
then click Run an AI visibility check.

00:00:19.692 --> 00:00:23.167
Your buyer questions are asked
on every assistant listed here,

00:00:23.217 --> 00:00:28.317
from ChatGPT and Perplexity to
Gemini, Claude and Google's AI.

00:00:29.351 --> 00:00:32.086
Next, add the buyer
topics you want covered,

00:00:32.136 --> 00:00:34.936
or leave it empty to use
your tracked keywords.

00:00:34.986 --> 00:00:37.019
Your competitors are filled in for you.

00:00:38.024 --> 00:00:42.809
Then check the Summary. The price, in
credits, covers your whole question list,

00:00:42.859 --> 00:00:44.882
and you see it before anything starts.

00:00:45.898 --> 00:00:50.523
Hover the question mark beside Website
and market to see what the price covers:

00:00:50.573 --> 00:00:53.009
every question, on every assistant.

00:00:53.969 --> 00:00:56.994
When it looks right,
click Check AI visibility.

00:00:57.044 --> 00:01:00.549
It takes about 10 minutes, and you
can leave the page while it runs.

00:01:01.508 --> 00:01:05.608
When it's done, AI visibility shows
how often you're named and cited,

00:01:05.658 --> 00:01:09.092
your share of voice, and the
visits AI assistants send you.

00:01:10.075 --> 00:01:13.925
If weekly tracking is on, this
check already runs every week.

00:01:13.975 --> 00:01:16.759
Run it yourself whenever
you want fresh answers now.

00:01:17.778 --> 00:01:22.633
So, open AI visibility, choose your
topics and competitors, check the price,

00:01:22.683 --> 00:01:23.792
and start the check.

00:01:24.832 --> 00:01:30.254
Now you can check if AI names you.
Next, read your results in tutorial 8.2.
